rust-wallet/test-scripts/
# Bitcoin Wallet Databases (NEVER commit - contains private keys!)                                                           
rust-wallet/HodosBrowser/                                                                                                    
**/wallet/wallet.db                                                                                                          
**/wallet/wallet.db-shm                                                                                                      
**/wallet/wallet.db-wal 
